Minahal ka ng lahat, saan ka man magpunta.

503
00:34:08.755 --> 00:34:11.299
-Ako ba?
-Oo.

504
00:34:11.382 --> 00:34:12.467
Maghintay ka lang at tingnan.

505
00:34:12.550 --> 00:34:15.344
Kahit yung team leader na yun or whatever

506
